  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Program for Prevention and Response to Violence and Criminality in Ecuador (PREVIC)</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa de Prevenci&#xf3;n y Respuesta a la Violencia y la Criminalidad en el Ecuador (PREVIC)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo general de desarrollo de esta operaci&#xf3;n es contribuir a prevenir los delitos asociados a Grupos de Delincuencia Organizada (GDO), y a reducir su impunidad, en territorios priorizados. Los Objetivos Espec&#xed;ficos de Desarrollo (OED) son: (i) aumentar la cobertura de los programas de prevenci&#xf3;n del Crimen Organizado (CO) y la atenci&#xf3;n a poblaciones vulnerables; (ii) aumentar la eficacia de la investigaci&#xf3;n criminal; y (iii) aumentar las capacidades del personal y uso de la informaci&#xf3;n para la gesti&#xf3;n de la seguridad.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The general development objective of this operation is to contribute to preventing crimes associated with Organized Crime Groups (OCGs) and to reduce their impunity in prioritized territories. The Specific Development Objectives are: (i) to increase the coverage of Organized Crime prevention programs and attention to vulnerable populations; (ii) to increase the effectiveness of criminal investigation; and (iii) to increase the capacities of personnel and the use of information for security management and governance.</narrative>
  </description>
